      "question": "How does our ZIP code unlock more prizes?",
      "answer": "Three thresholds. At 50 verified children a ZIP unlocks silver medals, at 100 it adds grade champions, and at 150 every campus in the ZIP switches on with a $2,500 bonus.\n\nSmaller ZIP codes are not held to the same raw numbers: they hit those thresholds at 25, 40 and 50 percent of their middle-school population, whichever number is lower.\n\nParticipation thresholds freeze on November 20. Registration itself stays open until December 20, which is why the two dates are different.",
